#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:5 cb9b919f9f934473adddc710527adb20
msgid "Crash Check"
msgstr "坠机检测"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:7 37e4a15e311349ab84f92f3fd1476359
msgid ""
"Copter includes a crash check which disarms the motors in cases where the "
"vehicle is likely out of control and has hit the ground.  This reduces "
"damage to the vehicle and also reduces the chance of injury to people near "
"the vehicle."
msgstr "Copter 包含坠机检测功能，当飞行器可能失控并撞击地面时会自动上锁电机。这可以减少飞行器的损坏，也降低对附近人员造成伤害的可能性。"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:9 44565f7faafd42cb8991dd65fcf4f59c
msgid ""
"The crash check is similar to the :ref:`parachute release <common-"
"parachute>` logic except that the parachute will normally release as the "
"vehicle falls, while the crash check should trigger once the vehicle has hit"
" the ground."
msgstr ""
"坠机检测与 :ref:`降落伞释放 <common-parachute>` "
"逻辑类似，区别在于降落伞通常在飞行器坠落时释放，而坠机检测应在飞行器撞击地面后触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:12 8205fbc383054308bcc3734e4f94d073
msgid "When will the crash check disarm the motors?"
msgstr "坠机检测何时会上锁电机？"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:13 f025ea771225498bb94ada94f038a54b
msgid "When all the following are true for 2 full seconds:"
msgstr "当以下所有条件连续满足 2 秒时："

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:15 a7df632e37534835904261db7e345268
msgid "the vehicle is armed"
msgstr "飞行器已解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:16 0b6716b184b24d98817026896594f920
msgid "the vehicle is not landed (as far as it can tell)"
msgstr "飞行器未降落（就其所能判断的情况而言）"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:17 b4074e1d896c4b2a8db3c817837b9598
msgid "the current flight mode is *not* ACRO or FLIP"
msgstr "当前飞行模式*不是* Acro 或 Flip"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:18 ab0ab896150f44fcbe41757336062c34
msgid "the vehicle is not accelerating by more than 3m/s/s"
msgstr "飞行器的加速度不超过 3m/s/s"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:19 7308dfd58fb94ef58fc0ad60692dac4c
msgid ""
"the actual lean angle has diverged from the desired lean angle (perhaps "
"input by the pilot) by more than 30 degrees"
msgstr "实际倾斜角与期望倾斜角（可能由飞手输入）相差超过 30 度"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:21 a43c0f7d10c04ad495d0c8801a0150bc
msgid ""
"Additional internal gating, such as speed and lean-angle checks, may also "
"apply before the motors are disarmed."
msgstr "在电机上锁之前，还可能应用额外的内部判据，例如速度和倾角检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:24 8d72e9789c8e489a8c6f9c1d2fa14808
msgid "What will happen when the crash check fires?"
msgstr "坠机检测触发后会发生什么？"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:26 6f962a18f4d647b9b23bb6b56fa49429
msgid "the motors will disarm"
msgstr "电机将上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:27 9f0368f2eea54ae788f5b6221418cf28
msgid "\"Crash: Disarming\" will be displayed on the Ground Station"
msgstr "地面站将显示 「Crash: Disarming」（碰撞：正在锁定）"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:28 253eacd8676d4abebc6c166939510807
msgid ""
"a crash event will be written to the dataflash logs (look for the "
"corresponding ERR record)"
msgstr "坠机事件将写入 dataflash 日志（查找对应的 ERR 记录）"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:31 f77e1f9d3db24db6b0f0c030035b994e
msgid "How and when should the crash check be disabled?"
msgstr "何时以及如何禁用坠机检测？"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:32 5c16d6e265e244df91f46665b78106ac
msgid ""
"In general the crash check should be left enabled but if the vehicle is "
"likely to suffer from lean angle errors of over 30 degrees for a second or "
"more it should be disabled.  This includes applications where the vehicle is"
" being used to carry a guide wire from one mountain peak to another or being"
" used for \"drone boarding\"."
msgstr ""
"通常应保持坠机检测启用，但如果飞行器可能因一秒或更长时间内倾斜角误差超过 30 "
"度而触发，则应禁用。这包括飞行器被用于在山峰之间拉引导线或用于\"无人机滑板\"的应用场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:37 ba722b01251242b58072876ebd7fdba7
msgid ""
"Image courtesy of `The Verge "
"<https://www.theverge.com/2016/2/3/10905970/droneboarding-is-happening>`__"
msgstr ""
"图片由 `The Verge <https://www.theverge.com/2016/2/3/10905970/droneboarding-is-"
"happening>`__ 提供"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:39 3999bc090ae64e60b9861d8c292fc8e7
msgid ""
"In Copter-3.3.3 (and higher) the crash check can be disabled by setting "
":ref:`FS_CRASH_CHECK <FS_CRASH_CHECK>` to 0."
msgstr ""
"在 Copter-3.3.3（及更高版本）中，可通过将 :ref:`FS_CRASH_CHECK <FS_CRASH_CHECK>` 设置为 0 "
"来禁用坠机检测。"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:41 a9f7394d1d0f43a9bb2f259b67afb533
msgid ""
"Below is a video describing the crash check from Copter-3.1 (the logic has "
"changed in 3.3 and higher)"
msgstr "以下视频描述了 Copter-3.1 中的坠机检测功能（3.3 及更高版本中的逻辑已有所改变）"
